msgid "Literature Search Tools Tutorial"
msgstr "文献检索工具教程"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:4
#: 53350e7478a84b0a82bb9ade7d57e013
msgid ""
"This comprehensive tutorial demonstrates how to use the literature search "
"tools available in ToolUniverse for finding academic papers, preprints, and "
"research articles across multiple databases."
msgstr ""
"本综合教程演示了如何使用 ToolUniverse 中提供的文献检索工具，跨多个数据库查找"
"学术论文、预印本及研究文章。"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:7
#: b8483dd9c7684e2bbfc47d4c8ceed0b7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:9
#: c0b0176c395e429981dd2e8541312c3c
msgid ""
"ToolUniverse provides 15 powerful literature search tools that cover "
"different aspects of academic research. All tools have been optimized with "
"enhanced data extraction, comprehensive metadata, and data quality "
"indicators:"
msgstr "ToolUniverse 提供 15 种强大的文献检索工具，涵盖学术研究的不同方面："

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:11
#: 1166037dcf8a411698fe541dc8b331a3
msgid ""
"**Preprint Archives:** - ArXiv - Physics, mathematics, computer science, and "
"other fields - BioRxiv - Biology preprints - MedRxiv - Medical preprints - "
"HAL - French research archive"
msgstr ""
"**预印本档案库：**  \n"
"- ArXiv - 物理学、数学、计算机科学及其他领域  \n"
"- BioRxiv - 生物学预印本  \n"
"- MedRxiv - 医学预印本  \n"
"- HAL - 法国科研档案库"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:17
#: 2356be7ef5544208bcaa65e761f887e7
msgid ""
"**Academic Databases:** - Crossref - Scholarly articles with DOI metadata - "
"PubMed - Medical and life sciences literature - Europe PMC - Biomedical "
"literature - Semantic Scholar - AI-powered academic search - OpenAlex - Open "
"academic graph - DBLP - Computer science bibliography"
msgstr ""
"**学术数据库：**  \n"
"- Crossref - 带有 DOI 元数据的学术文章  \n"
"- PubMed - 医学与生命科学文献  \n"
"- Europe PMC - 生物医学文献  \n"
"- Semantic Scholar - 人工智能驱动的学术搜索  \n"
"- OpenAlex - 开放学术图谱  \n"
"- DBLP - 计算机科学文献目录"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:25
#: 7b544ba8a8794fceb506de759fb84d3d
msgid ""
"**Open Access Tools:** - DOAJ - Directory of Open Access Journals - "
"Unpaywall - Open access status checker - CORE - World's largest open access "
"research papers collection - PMC - PubMed Central full-text biomedical "
"literature - Zenodo - Open research data and publications repository"
msgstr ""
"**开放获取工具：**  \n"
"- DOAJ - 开放获取期刊目录  \n"
"- Unpaywall - 开放获取状态检查工具  \n"
"- CORE - 全球最大的开放获取研究论文集合  \n"
"- PMC - PubMed Central 生物医学全文文献库  \n"
"- Zenodo - 开放研究数据与出版物存储库"

