#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:95
#: 66fa247148874b48ac858073e0937cfd
msgid ""
"All literature search tools have been optimized with the following "
"enhancements:"
msgstr "所有文献检索工具已通过以下改进进行了优化："

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:97
#: 3e9e5977b34644708e4d0f41d85282d1
msgid ""
"**Comprehensive Data Extraction:** - Authors information with proper "
"formatting - DOI (Digital Object Identifier) extraction - Citation counts "
"where available - Open access status indicators - Keywords and subject terms "
"- Article type classification - Publisher information - Data quality "
"indicators for transparency"
msgstr ""
"**全面数据提取：**  \n"
"- 作者信息（格式规范）  \n"
"- DOI（数字对象唯一标识符）提取  \n"
"- 引用次数（如有）  \n"
"- 开放获取状态指示  \n"
"- 关键词和主题词  \n"
"- 文章类型分类  \n"
"- 出版商信息  \n"
"- 数据质量指标（以确保透明性）"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:107
#: bfa7e77c6d9342989057192c021fa567
msgid ""
"**Improved Error Handling:** - Enhanced rate limit handling with automatic "
"retry - User-friendly error messages - Graceful handling of missing data - "
"Consistent fallback values"
msgstr ""
"**改进的错误处理：**  \n"
"- 增强的速率限制处理，支持自动重试  \n"
"- 用户友好的错误消息  \n"
"- 优雅地处理数据缺失情况  \n"
"- 提供一致的回退值"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:113
#: 6873f49613cf4654803a47c580c1ebd4
msgid ""
"**Data Quality Transparency:** - Each result includes a `data_quality` "
"object - Boolean indicators for field availability - Clear indication of "
"missing vs. unavailable data - Consistent data structure across all tools"
msgstr ""
"**数据质量透明性：**  \n"
"- 每个结果包含一个 `data_quality` 对象  \n"
"- 字段可用性的布尔值指示器  \n"
"- 清晰区分数据缺失与数据不可用  \n"
"- 所有工具中的数据结构保持一致"

#: ../../guide/literature_search_tools_tutorial.rst:119
#: 9ea1f5631a674c988c4aff035794ba41
msgid ""
"**Advanced Metadata:** - HTML tag cleaning for abstracts - Abstract "
"reconstruction from inverted indexes (OpenAlex) - Multi-mode API calls for "
"comprehensive data (Europe PMC) - Enhanced author and affiliation extraction"
msgstr ""
"**高级元数据：**  \n"
"- 清理摘要中的HTML标签  \n"
"- 从倒排索引（OpenAlex）重建摘要  \n"
"- 多模式API调用以获取全面数据（Europe PMC）  \n"
"- 提升作者与机构信息提取"

